      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that but it's just a few dots... it's not like i'm blind lol. i'm just really stressed and my head has been hurting a bit too. honestly i'm worried it's just a migraine coming on. if i take some really strong ibuprofen and just rest in a dark room for a few hours, do you think that would fix it? i'd rather just deal with it at home than spend a fortune on an emergency eye doctor visit.",
